#, javascript-format
msgid "Service %d"
msgstr "服务 %d"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/liteportal/common.js:165
msgid ""
"port not classified - a port number does not say which protocol is spoken on "
"it"
msgstr "端口类型未识别 —— 端口号本身不表示其上使用的协议"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/liteportal/common.js:169
msgid "Local services found"
msgstr "发现本地服务"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/liteportal/common.js:170
msgid ""
"These local services are not bookmarked yet. The ones you tick are added as "
"disabled bookmarks, so nothing appears on the portal page until you enable "
"them and press \"Save & Apply\"."
msgstr ""
"以下本地服务尚未加入书签。勾选后会以默认禁用的方式添加，因此在启用它们并点"
"「保存并应用」之前，不会出现在门户页上。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/liteportal/common.js:178
#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/liteportal/assets.js:387
#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/liteportal/assets.js:424
